The “Queen Alice” reading sample is chapter IX of Through the Looking-Glass
by Lewis Carroll (1871). The text is in the public domain in the United States.
The transcription follows Project Gutenberg eBook 12 and preserves the
chapter’s emphasis and verse breaks.

    https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/12

